# Reenact the Crime: "a graveyard" is either player's. Bot2's Giver of Runes (cast on turn 2) is bolted on turn 3 and so put into Bot2's
# graveyard this turn; Reenact the Crime exiles it, copies the card in exile and Bot1 casts the copy for free. A permanent spell's copy
# becomes a token as it resolves (CR 707.10f), under Bot1's control: Bot1 has the Giver, Bot2's graveyard is empty and the Giver card
# stays in exile.

